Chapter: DiskFactsCountWide
  cites Kernel chapter DiskFacts
  cites Foreword chapter FactStore
  cites Foreword chapter Hamt
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe
  cites Foreword chapter Sha256

 disk-facts-load.disk with the superblock's fact-count set to 2^63-1, from
 build/mint-facts-fixtures.ps1. The store must load as UNUSABLE and refuse the
 write: trapping at the add is a denial of service, and loading it empty would
 write the fact over the log that is there.

Section: Body

  opening : [Console, Device.Block] Nothing = act
    let store = disk-load
    in let after = disk-write-fact store DefinitionFact "probe" 1
    in print-line-uni ("usable=" & show (disk-usable store) & " facts=" & show (disk-fact-count after))
  end